    <mxCell id="legend_title" value="Legend &amp; Invariants" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="49" y="931" width="1882" height="22" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
    <mxCell id="legend_text" value="1. Each function: receive, check idempotency, read the persisted input, call Bedrock once, write one result, delete the message.&lt;br/&gt;2. A failed call changes nothing; after 5 attempts the message waits 14 days in its DLQ for operator redrive.&lt;br/&gt;3. Objects with a person go to restricted/; no function or person holds its key.&lt;br/&gt;4. Only inf-threshold is coded (B10); the three drone functions are architecture only.&lt;br/&gt;5. Solid = live path; dashed = error, DLQ, redrive or not deployed." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#334155;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="49" y="953" width="1882" height="102" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
